cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "citation-verifier: a browser tool that checks references against bibliographic databases"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Onoja
    given-names: Anthony
    affiliation: University of Surrey
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Donmaston09/citation-verifier"
abstract: >-
  Checks each reference against Crossref, DataCite, PubMed and Semantic
  Scholar, and flags hallucinated, mismatched, unregistered or retracted
  citations for a person to review. It never changes the references.
keywords:
  - citation verification
  - reference checking
  - research integrity
  - retractions
  - Crossref
